---

This project bundles invocations of the following third-party AI models. They
have their own licenses; please consult them before using this project for
commercial purposes:

- **Demucs (htdemucs_6s)** — MIT, by Facebook AI Research
  https://github.com/facebookresearch/demucs
- **BS-RoFormer Vocals** — MIT / model weights under separate terms
  https://github.com/lucidrains/BS-RoFormer
- **UVR-DeEcho-DeReverb** — Ultimate Vocal Remover community model
  https://github.com/Anjok07/ultimatevocalremovergui
- **audio-separator** — MIT
  https://github.com/nomadkaraoke/python-audio-separator
